<mxCell id="tier_transit" value="transit tier | 10.82.0.0/20 (/28 attachment subnets)&#10;Transit Gateway VPC Attachment. Network ACL allows only 10.40.0.0/13 and 10.82.0.0/16 [CL-LNK-08]." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#14532d;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="2565" y="580" width="970" height="80" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="tier_app" value="application tier | 10.82.48.0/20 - AWS Interface Endpoints (execute-api, cognito-idp)&#10;- Reached on TCP 443 by Logística (reception &amp; sack reads [CC-LOG-01])&#10;- Reached on TCP 443 by Gerencia &amp; Soporte (reports web &amp; center app [CC-STF-01])&#10;- Reached on TCP 443 by Drone Ground Station (mission preload &amp; grant [CC-DRN-01])&#10;- Endpoint policy restricts access strictly to platform private API ARNs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#14532d;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="2565" y="675" width="970" height="150" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
