<mxCell id="tier_drone_reserved" value="drone_object_ingress tier | 10.82.32.0/20 (RESERVED TIER - NO ENDPOINTS IN PILOT)&#10;- RESERVED TIER: No interface endpoint created in pilot (ASM-140, CC-DRN-02)&#10;- Ground station routes directly to application and object_storage endpoints&#10;- Traffic from center ground station to this tier is explicitly DENIED and blackholed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#991b1b;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
