<mxCell id="node_public_api" value="Public Application API Front Door &amp; Sack Lookup [CL-TEL-03, CC-PUB-01]&#10;- Amazon CloudFront + AWS WAF + Cognito token validation (TCP 443)&#10;- Reached by Transporters (10.4x.4.0/24) for positions &amp; custody events [CC-TEL-02]&#10;- Reached by Transporters &amp; Visitors for public sack lookup [CC-PUB-01]&#10;- Logística reads sacks privately through tunnel application endpoint [CC-LOG-01]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0369a1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
