<mxCell id="node_ext_web" value="External Internet Web &amp; Vendor Update Services [CC-STF-04, CC-GST-05]&#10;- TCP 80/443, UDP 443 for Gerencia/Soporte staff web access (staff class, 28/7 Mbps gtd)&#10;- TCP 80/443 for Transporte &amp; Visitantes non-operational web (strictly capped, Priority 5)&#10;- Vendor OS/device management update allow-list for Logística [CC-LOG-03]&#10;- Port 25 SMTP relaying from guest/transporter phones [CC-GST-04] DENIED&#10;- Inbound connection initiation from internet to center [CC-LNK-08] DENIED" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0369a1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
